# Production Gummy branding

Read first:

- `docs/BRAND_SYSTEM.md`
- `plans/active/2026-07-25-production-brand-assets-cursor-addendum.md`

The founder supplied the final Gummy mascot mark, wordmark, horizontal lockup, vertical lockup, compact head mark, and three app-icon treatments on 2026-07-25.

## Hard rules

- These are production assets, not visual references.
- Do not redraw, recolor, stretch, crop, trace, approximate, or replace them with generated artwork.
- Do not recreate the wordmark with live text.
- Do not use CSS filters or hue rotation.
- Do not recolor the artwork for Day Gummy or Night Gummy.
- Do not use the Gummy monkey as Glopper's Agent avatar.
- Keep Gummy and Glopper explicitly separate.
- Preserve the full-resolution PNG masters and generate responsive web derivatives.
- Centralize runtime paths in `src/brand/gummy-assets.js`.
- Remove temporary `G` glyphs and `temporary artwork slot` copy only when their production replacements are wired and tested.

## Canonical source names

```text
gummy-mascot-head-master.png
gummy-lockup-horizontal-master.png
gummy-wordmark-master.png
gummy-lockup-vertical-master.png
gummy-mark-head-square.png
gummy-app-icon-detailed-square.png
gummy-app-icon-flat-round.png
gummy-app-icon-monogram.png
```

Expected repository root:

```text
public/brand/gummy/
```

The exact target paths, hashes, usage map, accessibility rules, and automated acceptance requirements are in the active addendum.

## Default placement

- top bar: horizontal lockup when readable; compact head mark when narrow;
- boot: monogram or compact head mark;
- guide/welcome: mascot head or vertical lockup;
- 16–48 px favicon: monogram;
- Apple/PWA icon: detailed square;
- round avatar contexts: flat round icon.

## Definition of done

Do not return a manual founder test list. Run automated visual, accessibility, asset-existence, hash, PWA, responsive, and preview checks. Return exact screenshots, artifact paths, CI result, deployed preview, and limitations.